Container.Overview:
[b]OpenViking[/b] is an open-source memory context database for AI agents.[br][br]
[b]Container behavior:[/b][br]
- Starts the OpenViking API server on port [b]1933[/b].[br]
- Starts the Console UI on port [b]8020[/b].[br]
- Starts the bundled [b]vikingbot[/b] by default.[br][br]
[b]Important first-run requirement:[/b][br]
Create the [code]ov.conf[/code] file [b]before starting the container[/b]. Mount it to [code]/app/ov.conf[/code].[br][br]
If your config binds the server to [code]0.0.0.0[/code], you [b]must[/b] set [code]server.root_api_key[/code] or OpenViking will refuse to start.[br][br]
[b]Suggested ov.conf example:[/b][br]
[code]{
  "server": {
    "host": "0.0.0.0",
    "port": 1933,
    "root_api_key": "INSERT_API_KEY_HERE"
  },
  "storage": {
    "workspace": "/app/data"
  },
  "log": {
    "level": "INFO",
    "output": "stdout"
  },
  "embedding": {
    "dense": {
      "backend": "openai",
      "api_key": "",
      "model": "",
      "api_base": "",
      "dimension": 1536
    }
  },
  "vlm": {
    "backend": "",
    "api_key": "",
    "model": "",
    "api_base": "",
    "temperature": 0.1,
    "max_retries": 3
  }
}[/code][br][br]
After startup, verify the API with [code]http://[IP]:1933/health[/code].
